\newlabel{fig:main-bar}{{2}{7}{Answer F1 breakdown by dataset for the three key systems. \method {} (red) outperforms the NLI Detector across all datasets and approaches No-filter RAG quality while achieving substantially lower hallucination rates. Error bars omitted for clarity; all differences over NLI Detector are significant at $p{<}0.05$}{figure.caption.14}{}}
