\newlabel{tab:generalization}{{5}{7}{Generalization results on two held-out domains not used during any development stage. \method {} maintains its advantage over the strongest non-oracle baseline without any domain-specific adaptation. Primary metric: Answer F1. Bold = best per row}{table.caption.16}{}}
